play: block !important;\n    border-radius: 0.6cqi !important;\n  }\n</style>\n<p><!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n     CENNETIC L-1060 Two-Rail Vertical Machining Center\n     Product Detail Module — WordPress Custom HTML Block\n     Brand: CENNETIC | https://www.cennetic.com/\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --><br>\n  <!-- ══ Section 1: HERO ══ --><br>\n      <img src=\"/images/2026/06/cennetic-L1060-vertical-machining-center-main.webp\" alt=\"CENNETIC L-1060 Two-Rail Vertical Machining Center full view\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"eager\" data-srcpath=\"/images/2026/06/cennetic-L1060-vertical-machining-center-main.webp\"><br>\n      CENNETIC CNC MACHINERY<br>\n        L-1060<br>\n        Two-Rail Vertical Machining Center<br>\n        Precision-engineered with resin sand casting and double artificial aging treatment, the L-1060 delivers exceptional rigidity and long-term dimensional stability for high-demand machining applications.<br>\n        1000mmX-Axis Travel<br>\n        600mmY-Axis Travel<br>\n        600mmZ-Axis Travel<br>\n        BT40/160Spindle Taper<br>\n        8000rpmMax Spindle Speed<br>\n        24TTool Magazine<br>\n        Taiwan Spindle System<br>\n        C3 Grade Ballscrew<br>\n        Linear Guideway<br>\n        BT40 Interface<br>\n        24-Tool ATC<br>\n        <a href=\"https://www.cennetic.com/contact/\">Get a Quote</a><br>\n  <!-- ══ Section 5: SPEC COMPARISON TABLE ══ --><br>\n  Full Specifications — Model Comparison</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Specification</th>\n<th>Unit</th>\n<th>L-850</th>\n<th>L-1060 ★</th>\n<th>L-1370</th>\n<th>L-1580</th>\n<th>L-1890</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Axis Travel —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X-Axis Travel</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>850</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>1,300</td>\n<td>1,505</td>\n<td>1,900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Y-Axis Travel</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>700</td>\n<td>700</td>\n<td>700</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z-Axis Travel</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>700</td>\n<td>700</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Nose to Table (Min–Max)</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>110–610</td>\n<td>170–670</td>\n<td>150–750</td>\n<td>170–870</td>\n<td>180–880</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Center to Column</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>660</td>\n<td>800</td>\n<td>820</td>\n<td>820</td>\n<td>820</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Table —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Table Working Area</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>1,200×600</td>\n<td>1,300×600</td>\n<td>1,400×710</td>\n<td>1,700×900</td>\n<td>2,000×900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max. Table Load</td>\n<td>kg</td>\n<td>450</td>\n<td>800</td>\n<td>1,300</td>\n<td>1,300</td>\n<td>1,700</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T-Slot (Width × Pitch × Qty)</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>18T×5×90</td>\n<td>18T×5×100</td>\n<td>22T×5×140</td>\n<td>22T×5×140</td>\n<td>22T×5×165</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Spindle —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Taper</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>BT40/140</td>\n<td>BT40/160</td>\n<td>BT40/165</td>\n<td>BT50/155</td>\n<td>BT50/190</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max. Spindle Speed</td>\n<td>rpm</td>\n<td>8,000</td>\n<td>8,000</td>\n<td>8,000</td>\n<td>8,000</td>\n<td>8,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spindle Motor Power</td>\n<td>kW</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n<td>11/15</td>\n<td>15/18.5</td>\n<td>15/18.5</td>\n<td>15/18.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Feed System —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3-Axis Motor Power (X/Y/Z)</td>\n<td>kW</td>\n<td>2/2/3</td>\n<td>3/3/3</td>\n<td>3/3/3</td>\n<td>4.5/4.5/4.5</td>\n<td>4.5/4.5/4.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rapid Traverse (X/Y/Z)</td>\n<td>m/min</td>\n<td>24/24/15</td>\n<td>24/24/15</td>\n<td>16/16/12</td>\n<td>12/12/12</td>\n<td>12/12/12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ballscrew Dia. × Pitch (X/Y/Z)</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>X:36×4 Y:45×4 Z:40×8</td>\n<td>X:40×12 Y:40×12 Z:50×10</td>\n<td>X:40×12 Y:40×12 Z:50×10</td>\n<td>X:63×10 Y:50×10 Z:50×10</td>\n<td>X:63×10 Y:50×10 Z:55×12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Accuracy —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Positioning Accuracy</td>\n<td>mm/300mm</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repeatability</td>\n<td>mm/300mm</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— ATC &amp; Power —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tool Magazine Capacity</td>\n<td>pcs</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power Requirement</td>\n<td>KVA</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Air Pressure</td>\n<td>kg/cm²</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Machine Weight</td>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>11.5</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>15.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overall Dimensions (L×W×H)</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>2,860×2,500×2,800</td>\n<td>3,200×3,000×3,100</td>\n<td>4,350×3,300×3,400</td>\n<td>4,480×3,800×3,800</td>\n<td>4,800×3,900×3,500</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>  <!-- ══ Section 2: MECHANICAL FEATURES ══ --><br>\n  Mechanical Features<br>\n      🏗️<br>\n      High-Rigidity Resin Sand Casting<br>\n      The machine bed is manufactured using resin sand casting and undergoes two rounds of artificial aging treatment, ensuring high strength, dimensional stability, and resistance to deformation over long-term use.<br>\n      Double Aging Treatment<br>\n      ⚙️<br>\n      Full Taiwan Spindle System<br>\n      The complete spindle assembly is sourced from Taiwan, featuring imported P4-grade precision bearings assembled under constant temperature. Each spindle undergoes high-speed dynamic balancing for smooth, reliable operation.<br>\n      P4-Grade Bearings<br>\n      🔩<br>\n      C3-Grade Precision Ballscrew<br>\n      All three axes use imported C3-grade precision ballscrews with double-nut preloading and tail-end pre-tensioning. This configuration delivers exceptional rigidity, minimizes backlash, and ensures long-term positioning accuracy.<br>\n      Double-Nut Preload<br>\n      📏<br>\n      Linear &amp; Rectangular Guideways<br>\n      X and Y axes adopt linear guideways for low friction and high rapid traverse speed. The Z-axis uses rectangular guideways with imported wear-resistant scraped surfaces, providing superior rigidity and durability.<br>\n      Imported Wear-Resistant<br>\n      🛢️<br>\n      Centralized Lubrication System<br>\n      The entire machine uses a centralized lubrication system with pressure detection and volumetric oil distribution. This guarantees precise, metered lubrication to all critical components, extending service life significantly.<br>\n      Pressure Monitoring<br>\n      🎯<br>\n      High-Precision Three-Axis Configuration<br>\n      The three-axis system achieves positioning accuracy of ±0.005/300mm and repeatability of ±0.003/300mm, meeting the demands of precision mold making, aerospace components, and complex part machining.<br>\n      ±0.003mm Repeatability<br>\n  <!-- ══ Section 3: Z-AXIS STRUCTURAL HIGHLIGHTS ══ --><br>\n  Z-Axis &amp; Column Structural Advantages<br>\n  <img src=\"/images/2026/06/cennetic-L1060-z-axis-column-structure.webp\" alt=\"CENNETIC L-1060 Z-axis column inverted V-shape structure detail\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" data-srcpath=\"/images/2026/06/cennetic-L1060-z-axis-column-structure.webp\"></p>\n<h2>Precision Z-Axis Engineering &amp; Column Design</h2>\n<p>          ✓</p>\n<p><strong>Inverted V-Shape Column:</strong> The “inverted V” rib structure effectively increases column rigidity, suppresses vibration during heavy cutting, and eliminates machining chatter.</p>\n<p>          ✓</p>\n<p><strong>Counterbalance Design:</strong> The Z-axis adopts a counterbalance system to ensure consistent positioning accuracy and excellent cutting rigidity throughout the full stroke range.</p>\n<p>          ✓</p>\n<p><strong>Full Sheet Metal Machining:</strong> All sheet metal mounting surfaces are fully machined, ensuring precise alignment during assembly and simplifying maintenance procedures.</p>\n<p>          ✓</p>\n<p><strong>Dedicated Z-Axis Guard Design:</strong> The Z-axis protective cover features a specially designed contact surface that prevents the cover from scratching or damaging the guideways during operation.</p>\n<p>          ✓</p>\n<p><strong>True Coolant Separation:</strong> The genuine coolant-chip separation structure keeps the machine environment clean, improves coolant reuse efficiency, and enhances overall environmental performance.</p>\n<h3>BT40 Spindle Head</h3>\n<p>Taiwan-imported P4-grade bearings, constant-temperature assembly, high-speed dynamic balanced for smooth operation up to 8,000 rpm.</p>\n<h3>C3 Precision Ballscrew</h3>\n<p>Imported C3-grade ballscrew with double-nut preloading and tail-end pre-tensioning for zero backlash and long-term accuracy.</p>\n<h3>Precision Worktable</h3>\n<p>1,300×600mm working surface with standard T-slots (18T×5P×100), supporting up to 800kg workpiece load for heavy-duty applications.</p>\n<h3>24-Tool Disc ATC</h3>\n<p>Disc-type automatic tool changer with 24-tool capacity. Fast tool change cycle supports continuous multi-operation machining without interruption.</p>\n<p>  <!-- ══ CTA STRIP ══ --></p>\n<h2>Ready to Upgrade Your Machining Capability?</h2>\n<p>Contact our engineering team for customized solutions, pricing, and delivery schedules.</p>\n<p>      <a href=\"https://www.cennetic.com/contact/\">Get a Quote Now</a><br>\n      <a href=\"https://www.cennetic.com/contact/\">Contact Engineer</a><br>\n<!-- ══ END: CENNETIC L-1060 Detail Module ══ --></p>",
